      },
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "Having proved himself a skilled copyist, he began doing original work, notably a series of etchings which are the greatest embodiments of his greatest conceptions—the series called \"Eaux-fortes sur Paris.\"",
        "source": {
          "author": "Wikipedia contributors",
          "title": "Charles Meryon",
