    ],
    "matters": [
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "Meryon's real master in art was Reinier Zeeman, a Dutch etcher of the seventeenth century, whose views of the Paris of his day inspired our artist to undertake the great work of his life—his “Eaux fortes sur Paris.”",
